HB0335 Wyoming educational religious freedom act.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Brady
AN ACT relating to public education; prohibiting sectarian instruction and
practices in public institutions; providing definitions; specifying prohibited
practices; creating a complaint process; specifying duties of the state board
of education; requiring modification of accreditation status as specified;
providing enforcement; providing penalties; and providing for an effective date.
